# Release signing - the keystore and its passwords must never be committed.
# Losing this file means losing the ability to publish updates under the
# same signing identity, but committing it to a shared/public repo is worse -
# back it up somewhere private (password manager, encrypted drive) instead.
/keystore/*.jks
/keystore/*.keystore
/keystore/keystore.properties
